              highlighted: ["AG","DG"] },
            { text: "by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with {AG},",
              visible: ANNEX,
              highlighted: ["AG"] },
            { text: "therefore, if there is applied to {AG} a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on {DG}",
              visible: ANNEX,
              highlighted: ["AG","DG"] },
            { text: "and deficient by a square figure, then it divides it into incommensurable parts.",
